#. えー、長らくお待たせしました。
#. ではでは、学級裁判を<CLT 3>再開<CLT>しまーす！
msgctxt "0001 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Ahem! I do apologize for keeping you waiting. Now\n"
"then, let's <CLT 3>resume<CLT> the class trial!"
msgstr ""

#. 衝撃の事実発覚！　不二咲千尋は<CLT 3>男<CLT>だった！
#. では、その続きからどーぞ！！
msgctxt "0002 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"We've all just learned of the shocking revelation that\n"
"Chihiro was actually a <CLT 3>boy<CLT>! Let's pick up from there!"
msgstr ""

#. どんな理由があったかは知らないけど、
#. 不二咲千尋は女性ではなく男性だった…それは確かよ。
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Yes, well...I don't know his reason for hiding it, but\n"
"the fact is, Chihiro was not a girl, but a boy."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まさか…不二咲さんが男だったなんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>To think that Chihiro...was actually a guy.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そんなの…
#. 全然、気が付かなかった…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The thought had never even crossed my mind...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. そして、被害者が男性だったなら、
#. 男子更衣室にも問題なく入れたはずよ。
msgctxt "0006 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And because the victim was male, he would have had no\n"
"problem gaining access to the boys locker room."
msgstr ""

#. ヤツの電子生徒手帳が男の物なら…
#. そうなるな…
msgctxt "0007 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Assuming his handbook did, in fact, list his gender as\n"
"male...then yes, that would be true."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん、<CLT 3>男子の電子生徒手帳<CLT>を配ってあるよ！
#. だって、不二咲クンは男の娘だもん！！
msgctxt "0008 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"Of course <CLT 3>his handbook said he was a boy<CLT>! He dressed\n"
"like a girl, but he was a boy through and through!"
msgstr ""

#. そうなると、苗木君の推理通りだとしても、
#. 何も問題ないわね…
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"So then, there should be no issue with Makoto's\n"
"initial assertion..."
msgstr ""

#. 被害者は男子更衣室で殺され、
#. その後、女子更衣室に運ばれた…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"The victim was killed in the boys locker room, and was\n"
"then later moved to the girls locker room."
msgstr ""

#. 女子更衣室に入る時は、舞園さんや江ノ島さんの
#. 電子生徒手帳を使えば容易だったはずよ。
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"And the killer could have easily used Sayaka or\n"
"Junko's handbook to get into the girls locker room."
msgstr ""

#. では、不二咲くんが殺された現場は、
#. 本当に男子更衣室だったのだな！？
msgctxt "0012 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "So Chihiro really was killed in the boys locker room!?"
msgstr ""

#. 相変わらず、現場を移動させた意図はわからないけど…
#. その可能性は高いでしょうね。
msgctxt "0013 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I still don't understand the motive for moving the\n"
"body, but...yes, that does seem plausible."
msgstr ""

#. そうか…妙だと思ったんだ…
msgctxt "0014 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Well...I must admit, I did find it rather odd..."
msgstr ""

#. あいつの体の感触…女の体の割には…
#. どうも違和感があった…
msgctxt "0015 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I knew he felt a little...off. There was a certain\n"
"incongruity to his \"female\" body."
msgstr ""

#. なんか…興奮するシチュエーションね…！
msgctxt "0016 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "This is a most titillating situation!"
msgstr ""

#. だが…これで繋がった…
#. すべての謎がようやく明らかになったな…
msgctxt "0017 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So now everything has been connected. All the\n"
"mysteries have finally become clear."
msgstr ""

#. 明らかになるも何も…
#. あんたが犯人って流れだったはずだけど…？
msgctxt "0018 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"Okay, well, connected or clear or whatever... We still\n"
"think *you're* the killer, remember?"
msgstr ""

#. フフ…面白い…
#. 実に面白いじゃないか…
msgctxt "0019 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Hmhm. Very interesting. This has become very\n"
"interesting indeed..."
msgstr ""

#. あーあ、違う世界に行ってしまいましたな…
msgctxt "0020 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid "Ahh, he's off in his own little world..."
msgstr ""

#. それで、苗木君はどう思うの？
#. これでもまだ、犯人は十神君だと思うの？
msgctxt "0021 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"What about you, Makoto? After everything we've\n"
"learned, do you still think Byakuya's the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. …不二咲さんの死をジェノサイダー翔の犯行に
#. 見せかけたのは、間違いなく十神クンだったと思う。
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Well, without a doubt Byakuya's the one that made\n"
"Chihiro's death look like Genocide Jack did it."
msgstr ""

#. だけど…
#. だけど…ボクは……
msgctxt "0023 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "But...but I..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. やっぱり…犯人は十神クンじゃないのかも…
msgctxt "0025 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "I think he might not actually be the killer after all."
msgstr ""

#. なぬ…？　そもそも苗木誠殿が言いだしっぺなのに？
msgctxt "0026 | HIFUMI YAMADA"
msgid ""
"What? But aren't you the one who accused him in the\n"
"first place?"
msgstr ""

#. だって、十神クンの余裕の態度…
#. 謎が解けるのを楽しんでいるみたいだ…
msgctxt "0027 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He just seems to be too...easygoing about all this.\n"
"Like he's enjoying us solving the mystery..."
msgstr ""

#. まるで他人事だよ…
#. そんな風に振舞っていられるのって…
msgctxt "0028 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"The way he's acting, it makes it seem like it doesn't\n"
"have anything to do with him."
msgstr ""

#. 実際に、他人事だから…？
msgctxt "0029 | CELES"
msgid ""
"And you think that might be because it *doesn't* have\n"
"anything to do with him?"
msgstr ""

#. それに、十神クンが残した証拠は…
#. なんて言うか、あからさま過ぎるんだよ。
msgctxt "0030 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Plus, the evidence he left behind was a little\n"
"too...how can I put it? Overt."
msgstr ""

#. わざわざ延長コードを使う事で、
#. 自分が関わった証拠を、あえて残したような…
msgctxt "0031 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"He consciously chose to use the extension cord,\n"
"knowing it could connect him to the murder."
msgstr ""

#. そんな風に思えるんだ…
msgctxt "0032 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "At least, that's how I see it..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0033 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. それに、キミは殺害現場が男子更衣室だと知った時、
#. 明らかに動揺した様子を見せたよね…
msgctxt "0034 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And Byakuya, when you found out the murder took place\n"
"in the boys locker room, it seemed to rattle you."
msgstr ""

#. 不二咲さんが男だと知った時もだよ…
msgctxt "0035 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"And then again when you found out Chihiro was actually\n"
"a guy..."
msgstr ""

#. 本当の犯人なら、
#. そんなところで動揺するはずがないのに…
msgctxt "0036 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"If you really were the killer, that stuff wouldn't\n"
"have had any effect on you."
msgstr ""

#. なるほどな…そうか…
#. 明確な根拠がないのが気になるが…
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So that's your thinking, huh? Well, it bothers me that\n"
"you don't have more concrete reasons, but..."
msgstr ""

#. まぁ、いいだろう。
#. とりあえず正解にしておいてやるか。
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It's fine. I guess I'll mark it as correct, for the\n"
"time being."
msgstr ""

#. 正解…？
msgctxt "0039 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Mark it as...correct?"
msgstr ""

#. 苗木の言う通りだ。俺は犯人ではない。
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "He's right. I am not the culprit."
msgstr ""

#. たまたま、最初に女子更衣室で死体を見つけたんで、
#. あんな<CLT 3>偽装<CLT>をしてみたという訳だ。
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I just happened to come across the corpse in the girls\n"
"locker room, and decided to <CLT 3>alter<CLT> it."
msgstr ""

#. テ、テメェ…ふざけてんのか…？
msgctxt "0042 | MONDO OOWADA"
msgid "Are you fucking with us right now...?"
msgstr ""

#. ふざけてなどいない…これが<CLT 3>真相<CLT>だ。
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"No, I am not...effing with you right now. I'm telling\n"
"you <CLT 3>the truth<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. し、信じられるか…ッ！
msgctxt "0044 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Well I find it very hard to believe!"
msgstr ""

#. 信じたくないなら、それで結構。
#. みんなで仲良く処刑にでもなるか？
msgctxt "0045 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Go ahead, find it very hard to believe. You're free to\n"
"be executed along with the rest of us."
msgstr ""

#. もし、それが本当ならさ…
#. じゃあ、あんたはどうして死体の偽装なんかしたの？
msgctxt "0046 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"If you're really telling the truth, then...why? Why'd\n"
"you do that to his body?"
msgstr ""

#. そんな理由など、どうでもいい…
#. 今は犯人を当てる方が重要なはずだぞ？
msgctxt "0047 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"My reasons hardly matter right now. Uncovering the\n"
"culprit is much more important, wouldn't you say?"
msgstr ""

#. おい、苗木…俺が犯人ではないなら、
#. 本当の犯人は誰だと言うんだ？
msgctxt "0048 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Now then...if it wasn't me, who was it?"
msgstr ""

#. そ、それは…もう少し話し合ってみないと
#. わからないけど…
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"W-Well...I don't think I can say for sure without\n"
"talking about it a little more."
msgstr ""

#. まだ続けんの？　もういいんでない？
#. どう考えても十神っちが犯人だって！
msgctxt "0050 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"We're seriously gonna keep going? We're all good,\n"
"aren't we? I thought it was clear Byakuya did it!"
msgstr ""

#. …私は付き合うわよ。
#. 疑問があるなら、とことん話し合うべき。
msgctxt "0051 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"No, I'm with Makoto. If there's any doubt whatsoever,\n"
"we need to explore every possibility."
msgstr ""

#. もし、ここで判断を誤れば…
#. 私達はみんな揃って処刑されるんだし…
msgctxt "0052 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Because if we're wrong, we all die here."
msgstr ""

#. …そうですわね。
#. では、わたくしもお付き合い致しましょう。
msgctxt "0053 | CELES"
msgid "...That's true. Very well then, I'm with you, too."
msgstr ""

#. もちろん俺も参加するべ！
msgctxt "0054 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Damn straight! Count me in!"
msgstr ""

#. 君には意思というものがないのか！！
msgctxt "0055 | KIYOTAKA ISHIMARU"
msgid "Do you not have a mind of your own!?"
msgstr ""

#. 昆虫じゃねーし、意思くらいあんぞ！
msgctxt "0056 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Of course I do! What am I, an ant or somethin'?"
msgstr ""

#. とにかく、もう１度話し合ってみようよ。
#. 犯人を決めるのは、その後でも遅くないはずだよ？
msgctxt "0057 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Anyway, let's discuss this all as a group one more\n"
"time. We still have time to make our decision."
msgstr ""

#. 確かに、そうだな…
msgctxt "0058 | SAKURA OOGAMI"
msgid "That's very true..."
msgstr ""

#. 命…かかっちゃってるしね…
msgctxt "0059 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Our lives are all on the line..."
msgstr ""

#. それでは…犯人当てゲームの再開といこうか…
msgctxt "0060 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Excellent! Then shall we resume our game of hide and\n"
"seek?"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だけど、十神クンが犯人じゃないとすると…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0061 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But if Byakuya didn't do it...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>本当の犯人…
#. 不二咲さんを殺したのって誰なんだ？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0062 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then who's the real killer? Who murdered Chihiro?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は男
msgctxt "0063 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The killer is a guy"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人は女
msgctxt "0064 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The killer is a girl"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、違う…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0065 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that can't be right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場が男子更衣室だとすると、
#. そこに入るには男子の電子生徒手帳が必要となる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0066 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The murder scene was the boys locker room, and to get\n"
"in there you need a guy's handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>男子更衣室に入れない以上、
#. 犯人が女性のはずがない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0067 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A girl wouldn't have any way to get in, so none of\n"
"them could be the killer.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度考え直さないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0068 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better think about it again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0069 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 犯人はジェノサイダー翔
msgctxt "0070 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "The killer is Genocide Jack"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>いや、違う…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0071 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>No, that can't be right...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場が男子更衣室だとすると、
#. そこに入るには男子の電子生徒手帳が必要となる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0072 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The murder scene was the boys locker room, and to get\n"
"in there you need a guy's handbook.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>男子更衣室に入れない以上、
#. 犯人が女性のはずがない。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0073 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>A girl wouldn't have any way to get in, so none of\n"
"them could be the killer.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ましてや、ハリツケもしない、
#. 血文字も残さない犯行なんて…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0074 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Besides, the actual crime scene didn't have the bloody\n"
"message, and Chihiro wasn't suspended there.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ジェノサイダー翔ではありえない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0075 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So it couldn't have been Genocide Jack.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>もう一度考え直さないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0076 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'd better think about it again...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0077 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. …考え事か？
#. 気になる事があるなら言ってみろ。
msgctxt "0078 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Are you still thinking about something? If something's\n"
"on your mind, just go ahead and say it."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>えっと…男子更衣室で殺されたって事は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0079 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Umm...it has to do with the murder taking place in the\n"
"boys locker room.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>みんなのボクに対する印象が、
#. 悪くなったみたいだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0080 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Looks like I just embarrassed myself\n"
"in front of everyone...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少なくとも、
#. 現時点でわかってる犯人の特徴と言えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0081 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's one thing we can be sure that we know about\n"
"the killer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>少なくとも、
#. 現時点でわかってる犯人の特徴と言えば…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0082 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's one thing we can be sure that we know about\n"
"the killer...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>犯人が本当の現場に入れたって事は、
#. つまり犯人は…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0083 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The killer was able to gain access to the real murder\n"
"scene. Which means...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>現場が男子更衣室だとすると、
#. そこに入るには、<CLT><CLT 3>男子の電子生徒手帳<CLT><CLT 4>が必要となる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0084 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Since the crime scene was the boys locker room, you\n"
"would need a <CLT><CLT 3>boy's handbook<CLT><CLT 4> to get in...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>桑田クンの電子生徒手帳が使えない以上、
#. 犯人は自分の電子生徒手帳を使ったはずだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0085 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Since Leon's handbook is apparently broken, the killer\n"
"would have had to use their own.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>つまり…犯人は<CLT><CLT 3>男性<CLT><CLT 4>のはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0086 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>In other words...it had to have been a <CLT><CLT 3>guy<CLT><CLT 4>.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、これだけじゃ足りない。
#. 他にも…何か手掛かりを見つけないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0087 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that's still not enough... I need to find some\n"
"more clues.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
